 🚑 Final Numbers: Health care private equity 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Chart source: Bain &amp; Co. Data sources: Dealogic; AVCJ; Bain analysis First-half 2026 deals in the health care sector were down year-over-year, but remained strong by historical standards, per a new Bain &amp; Co. note.

 Provider-related transaction value jumped, across a range of subspecialties. Health care IT deal activity was hampered by the SaaSpocalypse. Sponsor sales were most likely "in areas with clear transformation theses, such as tech-enabled services." 
 
